Dimensions (weights): brief_adherence 20 · progression_causality 20 · pain_solution_link 25 · block_purpose_connectives 15 · proof_of_setup 10 · pacing_cta 10.
Also return "retell" (4 sentences a first-time viewer would say) and "scroll_away_second".

